#: templates/landing/index.html:1378
msgid "How does the free trial work?"
msgstr "Bepul sinov qanday ishlaydi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1382
msgid ""
"After registration, you get 30 days of full access with no restrictions. No "
"credit card is required. After the trial, you choose whether to continue "
"with the Standard plan."
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxatdan o'tgandan so'ng 30 kun davomida cheklovsiz to'liq kirish olasiz. "
"Kredit karta talab qilinmaydi. Sinov tugagandan so'ng Standart tarifga "
"o'tish yoki to'xtatish o'zingizga bog'liq."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1389
msgid "Do clients need to create an account?"
msgstr "Mijozlar ro'yxatdan o'tishi kerakmi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1393
msgid ""
"No. Clients book using just their name and phone number, then confirm with a "
"one-time SMS code. No registration, no app download."
msgstr ""
"Yo'q. Mijozlar faqat ism va telefon raqam bilan yoziladi, so'ng bir martalik "
"SMS kod bilan tasdiqlaydi. Ro'yxatdan o'tish va ilova yuklab olish shart "
"emas."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1400
msgid "How many staff members can I add?"
msgstr "Nechta xodim qo'shish mumkin?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1404
msgid ""
"As many as you need. Each staff member gets their own schedule, services, "
"and pricing. You pay 20,000 UZS per active staff member per month."
msgstr ""
"Xohlagancha. Har bir xodimning o'z jadvali, xizmatlari va narxlari bo'ladi. "
"Har bir faol xodim uchun oyiga 20 000 so'm to'lanadi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1411
msgid "Does it work on mobile phones?"
msgstr "Mobil telefonda ishlaydi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1415
msgid ""
"Yes, fully. Both the booking page (for clients) and the management dashboard "
"(for staff and owners) are mobile-friendly. No app download needed."
msgstr ""
"Ha, to'liq. Yozilish sahifasi (mijozlar uchun) ham, boshqaruv paneli "
"(xodimlar va egalar uchun) ham mobil qurilmalarga moslashtirilgan. Ilova "
"yuklab olish shart emas."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1422
msgid "How is payment handled?"
msgstr "To'lov qanday amalga oshiriladi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1426
msgid ""
"Currently billing is handled manually — contact us to discuss payment "
"details. Online payment integration is coming soon."
msgstr ""
"Hozircha to'lov qo'lda amalga oshiriladi — to'lov tafsilotlari uchun biz "
"bilan bog'laning. Tez orada onlayn to'lov qo'shiladi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1433
msgid "Can I cancel at any time?"
msgstr "Istalgan vaqtda bekor qila olamanmi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1437
msgid ""
"Yes. No contracts, no lock-in. Cancel or pause your account whenever you "
"want. Your data is always yours."
msgstr ""
"Ha. Shartnoma yo'q, majburiyat yo'q. Istalgan vaqtda bekor qiling yoki "
"to'xtatib qo'ying. Ma'lumotlaringiz har doim sizniki."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1444
msgid "Is my data secure?"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlarim xavfsizmi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1448
msgid ""
"Yes. All data is stored on encrypted servers. Client information and booking "
"history are only accessible to you and your staff."
msgstr ""
"Ha. Barcha ma'lumotlar shifrlangan serverlarda saqlanadi. Mijoz ma'lumotlari "
"va yozilish tarixi faqat siz va xodimlaringizga ko'rinadi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1455
msgid "Is there customer support?"
msgstr "Mijozlarga xizmat ko'rsatish bormi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1459
msgid ""
"Yes. Reach us via Telegram for fast support in Uzbek or Russian. We also "
"help with the initial setup at no extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Ha. Tez yordam uchun Telegram orqali murojaat qiling (o'zbek yoki rus "
"tilida). Boshlang'ich sozlashda ham bepul yordam beramiz."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1474
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "Boshlash"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1475
msgid "Ready to try it?"
msgstr "Sinab ko'rishga tayyormisiz?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1476
msgid ""
"Write to us on Telegram — we'll set up your account and walk you through the "
"first steps personally."
msgstr ""
"Telegram orqali yozing — hisobingizni sozlaymiz va birinchi qadamlarda "
"shaxsan yordam beramiz."

